  <result aggregation-status="1" type="1">
   <title>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">Annual Output Results</narrative>
   </title>
   <indicator ascending="0" measure="5">
    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Output Indicator</narrative>
    </title>
    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">IMPACT Indicators:
OO1: Percentage of population satisfied with local self-governments;
OO2: Municipal budget total receipts as a percentage of GDP;

OOUTCOME Indicators:
SO1:Municipal statistics system established and available to wider public;
SO2: Number of policy documents developed with engagement of MRDI coordination mechanism on regional policy/ITD (with engagement of RCCs);
SO3: Number of new property items under effective management of municipalities;
SO4: % Increase of the level of public awareness about the LSG reform, participation tools and mechanisms (%), disaggregated by women, youth and ethnic minorities;

OUTPUT Indicators:
1.1.(a) Number of central and local public institutions with increased capacities in policy planning and implementation
1.1.(b) Number of new municipal data indicators integrated into national statistics system
1.2.(a) Number of studies/technical documents prepared in support of municipal projects funded through PIRDP and state funds
1.3. (a) Number of thematic working groups established under the RCCs in target regions;
1.3. (b) Number of spheres for inter-municipal cooperation identified;
2.1. (a) Number of municipal services supported by EU4ITD project;
